WEBVTT

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:04.528
listening to me read the book,
and a kind of paradise was regained."

00:18:05.579 --> 00:18:08.441
I would like to end with this thought:

00:18:08.465 --> 00:18:10.976
That when we reject the single story,

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.976
when we realize that
there is never a single story

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.441
about any place,

00:18:16.465 --> 00:18:17.976
we regain a kind of paradise.

00:18:18.695 --> 00:18:19.817
Thank you.

00:18:19.841 --> 00:18:22.841
(Applause)